      "text": "[2:33PM] #PenCinema #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nOke Koto axis is currently experiencing heavy traffic due to the ongoing Maulud celebration in the area.  The Old Ipaja Road from Funmilayo inward Oke Koto is congested, as well as Alfa Nla inward Oke Koto. Oba Ogunji Road from Odo Eran towards Agege Bridge inward Oke Koto is also busy. However, the situation is under control as our officers are actively managing traffic across the corridor.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
